    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O’Connor Estate Agents are delighted to present Apt. 10 Bridgewater Hall, to the market. This stunning  1 bedroom apartment offers bright modern accommodation and is positioned beside the banks of the Royal Canal. It is within easy reach of the Dublin City Centre, Fairview & Drumcondra.\r\n\r\nThe apartment which is located on the 2nd floor provides a gated entrance and lift access to the apartment. Local amenities are abundant with schools, sports clubs and recreational facilities including Croke Park.\r\n\r\nApt. 10 which has been freshly painted comprises a large double bedroom, large living area with bay window, kitchen area, hallway,  large storage area and bathroom.\r\n\r\nIts excellent location offers superb transport links with Connolly & Drumcondra Train Station within close proximity.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: with wooden floor and storage area\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Room: c.5.53m x 3.42m with wooden floors and feature bay window.\r\n\r\nKitchen: c.2.66m x 2.40m with built in kitchen units and wall tiling.\r\n\r\nBedroom: c.3.55m x 3.37m with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom: c.2.37m x 2.26m with bath & shower, wc, whb and partial wall tiling.\r\n\r\nTransport:\r\n\r\nThis property is ideally positioned close to Dublin City Centre, Drumcondra and Fairview village. There is also an abundance of Dublin Bus options within easy reach of the apartment serving the entire City and Connolly Train Station is just a short walk away.\r\n\r\nAmenities:\r\n\r\nThere are an abundance of amenities within a stone’s throw of this property. Drumcondra Village is just minutes away while O’Connell Street, Ilac Centre, Jervis Centre, Smithfield, Temple Bar, Henry Street and Capel Street are all within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "2nd floor apartment\r\nLift access\r\nWithin close proximity to Dublin City Centre\r\nManagement fee: €1479.60\r\nGreat Transportation links\r\nClose to Drumcondra & Fairview Village\r\nElectric heating\r\nDouble glazed window"
      },
      {
